Subject: [PATCH 00888/11362] [outer-loop] On-policy harness built +
 smoke-validated: MiniCPM trains on its OWN verifier-scored traces

The clean (un-confounded) verifier-as-self-improvement test. MiniCPM5-1B generates its OWN
K traces per question (own verbosity -> no off-policy style/truncation asymmetry), verifier
scores them (process-reward), LoRA-SFT on its own process-reward-weighted traces. Reuses the
validated training + instrumented-eval (stop tokens, truncation guard, gold-control gate).
Smoke clean: generation+scoring+train+eval end-to-end, base eval truncation 0.0, own-sample-
correct 0.25 (the headroom the bootstrap uses). Launching full run (90 train Q x K=6).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
